    "The approved publisher namespace and WebUI catalog entry are seeded prerequisites, not a qualification of their admission APIs. Runtime registration and selection use actual APIs.",
    "The process test covers interruption after Registry commit and before worker exporter acknowledgement. It does not simulate mid-layer network interruption or Registry-process loss.",
    "Protected Instance adoption, real Sub2API credentials, production TLS/registry policy and release readiness."
